# =============================================================================
# ShoCode .gitignore
# This repo is PUBLIC (registration is by public PR). Anything committed here
# is world-readable. Internal planning, financials, partner docs, and the
# sponsor pipeline must NEVER be committed. See "Content visibility policy".
# =============================================================================

# --- Squad: runtime state (logs, inbox, sessions) ---
.squad/orchestration-log/
.squad/log/
.squad/decisions/inbox/
.squad/sessions/
.squad/.cache/
# Squad: SubSquad activation file (local to this machine)
.squad-workstream

# --- Sibling repos symlinked into the project (backed by .devcontainer bind mounts) ---
# Public landing page — ShoCodeJP/ShoCodeJP.github.io
site
# Private internal docs — ShoCodeJP/shocode-internal (sponsor pipeline, budget, venue, partner)
internal

# --- Dependencies / build artifacts ---
node_modules
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- Debug artifacts ---
.playwright-mcp/

# --- Staff ops files (now live in shocode-internal) ---
RUNBOOK.md
SCHEDULE_TEMPLATE*.md
schedule.yml

# =============================================================================
# Content visibility policy
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALWAYS-INTERNAL (never publish): sponsor pipeline, partner proposals, money,
# venue negotiation, internal planning. These are ignored below.
#
# PUBLIC-DESTINED but GATED: program/themes/awards, schedules, speaker guides,
# info pack, brand identity, etc. are NOT ignored, but must NOT be committed
# until their gates clear (Earthful Magic partnership confirmed; date + venue
# locked). Enforce via review/CODEOWNERS, not just this file.
# =============================================================================

# --- Sponsors: pipeline, prospect research, prospectus & rules drafts ---
# The sponsor pipeline lives in a PRIVATE store, not here (see
# marketing/sponsors/tracking-notes.md). Approved, public-facing prospectus/
# rules are published deliberately via the site repo when ready.
marketing/sponsors/

# --- Partnerships: confidential partner proposals (e.g. Earthful Magic) ---
partnerships/

# --- Internal event brief / proposal deck source ---
proposal/

# --- Operations: budget, venue negotiation, catering, MC, runsheet, power, AV ---
# CAVEAT: ops/venue-research.md is ALREADY committed/public — ignoring the dir
# does NOT untrack it. Decide separately whether to `git rm --cached` it
# (it candidly rates/eliminates named venues); history will still retain it.
ops/
# Private comms — emails, PII, planning conversations (also under ops/)
ops/comms/

# --- Internal pipeline / committee / direction notes ---
program/cfp-pipeline-notes.md
program/SCHEDULE_TEMPLATE*.md
program/schedule.yml
speakers/keynote-shortlist.md
speakers/cfp-committee-charter.md

# --- Internal attendee operations (capacity math, check-in, PII handling) ---
attendees/capacity-plan.md
attendees/checkin-process.md
attendees/dietary-accessibility-handoff.md
attendees/registration-flow-test-plan.md

# --- Internal marketing strategy (channels, unreleased timing) ---
marketing/outreach-channels.md
marketing/social-calendar-template.md

# --- Scripts: entire directory gitignored (tracked utilities live in .github/scripts/) ---
scripts/

# --- Convention: anything explicitly marked DRAFT in its filename stays out ---
# Rename (drop the -DRAFT suffix) only when approved for publication.
*-DRAFT.md
